Passgage is a native Go reimplementation based on passage by Filippo Valsorda,
which is based on password-store by Jason A. Donenfeld. The passage shell
implementation was used as the reference source and carries Copyright (C)
2012-2018 Jason A. Donenfeld <Jason@zx2c4.com>. All Rights Reserved.

Passgage also preserves Jenic Rycr's custom verbose-commit behavior from the
reference source. Vendored dependencies retain their own license notices.

